        Main Arena Controls:


        Arrow
        Keys for directions

        Space for Boost


        Press ''S'' for Sonar


        Sonar
        Mode:

        Press and hold Space for Fish Catching Whirl

        Arrows
        to turn Boat


        Hold Tab and press arrows to select from Tools'
